      C0 * (w j ρ + k * (N + S) + m * (tt + 1) * η + (if ρ ∈ TT then k * b' else 0))) →
      muC + hu - 2 * Fo ≤
        ∑ t ∈ TT, (m * (Formalism.LatticeIndexTer.ph (aT t) - aT t * logOm) - aT t * logT) +
